# Activity scene — game night, first time. cast.md § 4.3: the Sister Pioneer
# invites the player to a "group game night" at her parents' house; bright,
# "upbuilding"; the friends. Belonging, in its best light.
# TODO: authenticity check

Board games on a dining table, too many people for the chairs, somebody's toddler asleep on a pile of coats. You get a spot on the arm of the couch.
The regular pioneer who invited you is keeping score in tiny neat numbers. "Are you pioneering this month?" she asks, bright, not testing.
if GameState.is_pioneering():
	You say yes. "Oh, that's so upbuilding," she says, and means it, and writes your name at the top of the score sheet like a prize.
else:
	You say not this month. "Oh, you should! It's the best month of the year, every time." She says it like she's recommending a restaurant.
Someone laughs so hard at charades that they have to lie on the floor. It's past eleven when you leave. You feel light, the whole drive home.
